        <li>Clients dealing with GI side effects, slow gut motility, nausea, or gut-barrier discomfort.</li>
        <li>Clients in rapid weight-loss phases wanting structured tissue-repair support.</li>
        <li>Clients tapering off a GLP-1 who want to support metabolic and inflammatory transition.</li>
        <li>Active clients on a GLP-1 who train and want to keep training without losing what they have built.</li>
        <li>Clients who want medical guidance instead of stacking research peptides on prescription medications without supervision.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note-box">
        Eligibility for the GLP-1 Support Stack is determined during clinical consultation.
      </p>
