          Studied for its role in supporting tissue repair, the gut lining, and localized
          recovery. Particularly relevant for GLP-1 clients managing GI discomfort or
          motility issues.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="ingredient-tag">Lean Tissue & Cellular Energy</p>
