          flexibility, mitochondrial function, and exercise response. For GLP-1 clients,
          it is often considered to support lean-tissue preservation during rapid weight loss.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="ingredient-tag">Inflammatory Balance</p>
        <h3>KPV</h3>
        <p>
          A short tripeptide studied for its role in supporting inflammatory balance and
          gut barrier integrity. Often considered alongside GLP-1 protocols to support gut
          and inflammatory comfort.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="ingredient-tag">Cellular Coenzyme</p>
        <h3>NAD+</h3>
        <p>
          A cellular coenzyme studied for its role in mitochondrial energy production,
          DNA-repair pathways, and cellular cleanup. Included to support the energy demands
          of body-composition change.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="ingredient-tag">Master Antioxidant</p>
        <h3>Glutathione</h3>
        <p>
          A key antioxidant studied for its role in oxidative-stress balance and cellular
          defense. Included to support antioxidant capacity during rapid metabolic change.
        </p>
      </article>
